    "Data structures and interfaces": "classDiagram\n    class Direction {\n        +delta() tuple[int,int]\n        +is_opposite(other: Direction) bool\n        <<Enum>>\n    }\n    class Position {\n        +x: int\n        +y: int\n        <<immutable>>\n    }\n    class Grid {\n        -_width: int\n        -_height: int\n        +__init__(width: int, height: int)\n        +width() int\n        +height() int\n        +in_bounds(pos: Position) bool\n    }\n    class Snake {\n        -_body: list[Position]\n        -direction: Direction\n        +__init__(start: Position, direction: Direction)\n        +turn(requested: Direction) bool\n        +head() Position\n        +next_head() Position\n        +advance(grow: bool) None\n        +body() list[Position]\n    }\n    class RandomProvider {\n        -_queue: list[Position]\n        -_seed: int\n        +__init__(sequence: Optional[list[Position]] = None, seed: Optional[int] = None)\n        +next_position(grid: Grid) Position\n    }\n    class Game {\n        -_grid: Grid\n        -_rng: RandomProvider\n        -_snake: Snake\n        -_food: Position\n        -_score: int\n        -_over: bool\n        +__init__(grid: Grid, rng: RandomProvider, start: Position, direction: Direction)\n        +turn(requested: Direction) bool\n        +step() None\n        +reset() None\n        +state() dict\n        +is_over() bool\n        +score_get() int\n    }\n    Direction <.. Snake : uses\n    Position <.. Snake : uses\n    Grid <.. Game : uses\n    Snake <.. Game : orchestrates\n    RandomProvider <.. Game : uses\n    Position <.. RandomProvider : produces\n    class collision {\n        +hit_wall(grid: Grid, pos: Position) bool\n        +hit_self(body: list[Position], next_head: Position, grow: bool) bool\n    }\n    class food {\n        +place_food(grid: Grid, rng: RandomProvider, occupied: set[Position]) Position\n    }\n    Game --> collision : checks\n    Game --> food : places",
    "Program call flow": "sequenceDiagram\n    participant M as Main\n    participant G as Game\n    participant S as Snake\n    participant C as collision\n    participant F as food\n    participant RP as RandomProvider\n    M->>G: __init__(Grid(10,10), rng, start=(5,5), dir=RIGHT)\n    G->>RP: next_position(grid)\n    RP-->>G: initial food Position\n    M->>G: step()\n    G->>S: next_head()\n    S-->>G: Position(x+dx, y+dy)\n    G->>C: hit_wall(grid, next_head)\n    C-->>G: False (safe)\n    G->>C: hit_self(body, next_head, grow)\n    C-->>G: False (safe)\n    G->>S: advance(grow)\n    alt food consumed\n        G->>F: place_food(grid, rng, occupied)\n        F->>RP: next_position(grid)\n        RP-->>F: new food Position\n        F-->>G: new food Position\n        G->>G: score += 1\n    end\n    M->>G: state()\n    G-->>M: {width,height,snake,food,score,over,direction}\n    M-->>M: print snapshot\n    M-->>M: exit",
